%% case footer-order
%% source [LQ/errors §4.2]
%% source [LQ/envelope §6.1]
%% note The footer block of a result with W07 raised twice, N09 and W03: warnings in ascending code order, then notices;
%% note a code that fires twice prints once.
%% text
W03: t.done includes cancelled; write t.status = 'done' for completed only
W07: hand-derived readiness misses inherited and flagged blockers, markers, leases, defer_until and containers; use t.unblocked (structural) or t.ready (dispatchable now)
N09: 2 duplicate rows on this page; RETURN DISTINCT removes them
%% end
